{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"desc":"V5日志｜已进入24田直通路线","jsCode":"(function(){var p=\"\/sdcard\/Download\/收割预检诊断.txt\";try{var old=\"\";try{old=String(zdjl.readFile(p)||\"\");}catch(e){}var g=function(k){try{return String(zdjl.getVar(k,\"global\")||\"\");}catch(e){return \"?\";}};zdjl.writeFile(p,(old+\"\\n收割V5-20261010 | \"+new Date().toISOString()+\" | 已进入24田直通路线 | \"+g(\"收割预检植物结论\")+\"\/\"+g(\"收割预检成熟结论\")).slice(-25000));}catch(e){}try{zdjl.toast(\"收割V5｜已进入24田直通路线\",1250);}catch(e){} })();"}
{"type":"运行多个动作","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"desc":"第一组12田｜首格原地判定+23格／次格原地判定+22格，不重走起点","scriptCallbacks":{"afterExecFinish":{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"desc":"收割流程定位V3-20261010：第一组12田整体动作完成","jsCode":"(function(){\nvar pre=\"收割流程定位V3-20261010\",stage=\"第一组12田整体动作完成\", t=new Date().toISOString();\nfunction G(k){try{return String(zdjl.getVar(k,\"global\")||\"\");}catch(e){return \"读取失败:\"+String(e);}}\nvar p=G(\"收割预检植物结论\"),m=G(\"收割预检成熟结论\"),n=G(\"收割预检植物\"),\n ok=(p===\"白名单\"&&m===\"成熟\"),mark=\"植物=\"+p+\"(\"+n+\") 成熟=\"+m+\" 24田资格=\"+(ok?\"通过\":\"拒绝\");\ntry{var fn=\"\/sdcard\/Download\/收割预检诊断.txt\",old=\"\";try{old=String(zdjl.readFile(fn)||\"\");}catch(e){}\nzdjl.writeFile(fn,(old+\"\\n\"+pre+\" | \"+t+\" | \"+stage+\" | \"+mark).slice(-20000));}catch(e){}\n\n})();"}},"scriptSet":[{"type":"执行脚本","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"desc":"前两格命中白名单成熟：当前格原地收割判定（不再复位、重走）","filePath":"收割判定.zjs","continueCurrentAfterFinish":true},{"type":"运行多个动作","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"condition":{"type":"jsExpression","checkBeforeDelay":true,"expression":"Number(zdjl.getVar(\"收割预检起始格\",\"global\")||0)===1","desc":"仅第一格起点执行额外的1次左滑"},"desc":"第1格起点专属｜左滑至第2格（第2格起点跳过）","scriptSet":[{"type":"点击","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":1,"desc":"第一组12块地｜左3格｜移动前点击","scriptCallbacks":{"afterExecSuc":{"type":"控制执行","delay":"0.1","delayUnit":1,"controlRunType":"waitDelay","jumpToPosition":"","ContinueParentExecute":false}},"posData":{"type":"location","x":"39.6%","y":"70.3%"}},{"type":"滑动","duration":"750","delayUnit":1,"desc":"第一组12块地｜左3格｜移动","scriptCallbacks":{"afterExecFinish":{"type":"执行脚本","delayUnit":1,"desc":"到达地块：执行收割判定.zjs","filePath":"收割判定.zjs","continueCurrentAfterFinish":true}},"startPos":{"type":"location","x":"25%","y":"75%"},"endPos":{"type":"location","x":"5%","y":"75%"}}],"runMode":"normal"},{"type":"运行多个动作","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"repeatCount":2,"desc":"两种起点共用｜再左滑2格，到第一组第4格","scriptSet":[{"type":"点击","d